Exercise the ConfirmModal error path end to end through useConfirm: a
rejected destructive action keeps the dialog open, shows the generic
alert-role message without the thrown error text, and a successful retry
resolves true and closes the dialog. Also cover the declarative reopen
path that clears a stale failure message.

